WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.818
Buying work fairly takes care.

00:00:01.818 --> 00:00:06.545
Velstrian Buy helps a public or private buyer run a clear, even process.

00:00:06.545 --> 00:00:08.363
Start with the Requirement Builder.

00:00:08.363 --> 00:00:11.635
A requirement is what you ask suppliers to deliver.

00:00:11.635 --> 00:00:15.998
Build it step by step, and you can start from a template.

00:00:15.998 --> 00:00:20.361
Choose how the work goes to market, and send it to suppliers.

00:00:20.361 --> 00:00:30.542
Your pipeline shows upcoming and current contracts, with the views public buyers must publish, including the section ninety three pipeline notice and a contract register you can export.

00:00:30.542 --> 00:00:32.359
When bids are in, evaluate.

00:00:32.359 --> 00:00:34.541
Each evaluator sets their own scores.

00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:39.631
The headline is a fixed calculation, the same every time, never by artificial intelligence.

00:00:39.631 --> 00:00:43.994
Compare bids brings each supplier to one whole life figure per currency.

00:00:43.994 --> 00:00:46.539
It does not rank them for you.

00:00:46.539 --> 00:00:50.175
Record the award, shown in one place on the evaluation.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:52.721
After award, keep the supplier record current.

00:00:52.721 --> 00:00:58.174
Score a supplier with a scorecard, and hold regular reviews, both kept with the supplier.

00:00:58.174 --> 00:01:01.447
Track what the contract delivers with the Value tracker.

00:01:01.447 --> 00:01:04.355
Your primary data is stored in the EU.

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:09.446
Write the requirement, score it fairly, award it cleanly, and manage the supplier well.

00:01:09.446 --> 00:01:10.900
That is Velstrian Buy.
